# Skeleton - the shape of content that has not arrived. Size it with class(); shape: "" | circle | pill.
#   Skeleton(shape: "circle") class("size-8")    Skeleton() class("h-3 w-2/3")
# Build a whole placeholder from the SAME parts as the content (an Item with Skeletons in place of the text), so the
# swap changes pixels, not layout. Only while there is nothing to show: a refresh keeps the content.
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · Nova (.cn-skeleton) + kit.css (shimmer).
part Skeleton(shape: text = "") { Stack class("cn-skeleton") data(slot: "skeleton", shape: $shape) aria(hidden: "true") }
